OL,3,GNEWSABanned teacher sentenced for
OL,4,Abreaching court order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former freelance music teacher who
OL,7,Fwas banned from the profession after
OL,8,Fdownloading indecent images of children
OL,9,Fhas been given another suspended jail
OL,10,Fsentence for breaching his sexual harm
OL,11,Fprevention order.
OL,13,FDonal Donnelly, 61, was given a
OL,14,Fsuspended eight-month jail sentence at
OL,15,FYork Crown Court in December 2023 after
OL,16,Fbeing caught with more than 2,000
OL,17,Findecent images.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
