OL,3,GNEWSABanned teacher sentenced for
OL,4,Abreaching court order
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was also told to comply with a
OL,7,Ffive-year order, but in April 2025 a
OL,8,Froutine visit found he was using
OL,9,Fprivate browsing on his phone and its
OL,10,Finternet history was being deleted.
OL,12,FDonnelly was sentenced at Bradford
OL,13,FCrown Court on Tuesday to six months in
OL,14,Fjail, suspended for 18 months, and
OL,15,Fhanded a further harm prevention order.
